  "Choir of Doves Lv.$1": "",
  "Choir of Doves <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nIncrease party's DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $3 for every $2 points of Manaka's ATK, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> DMG Dealt. Lasts for $5 turn. Manaka gains $6 [Holy Song] stacks.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>At the break of dawn, a flock of doves descended gracefully from the sky, their serene melodies transforming into an invisible force, like a divine blade bestowed with sacred prophecy.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Poem of Radiance Lv.$1": "",
  "Poem of Radiance <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nRestore party's HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Manaka's ATK + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>, and cure 1 debuff. When Manaka has <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link>, spend 1 <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stack to decrease skill cooldown by 1 action, up to $3 actions. When Manaka manually uses this skill, increase healing by $4. \\nPassive: After Manaka gained $5 <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stacks, automatically activate the healing from this skill once.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Her lips part gently as ethereal songwaves ripple through the air, where luminous feathers touch, wounds are soothed, weariness and anguish swept away.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Wheel of Time Lv.$1": "",
  "Wheel of Time <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 4 Actions\\nIncrease party's ATK by $1 + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Manaka's ATK. Spend all <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link>, for each <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stack spent, increase party's Pierce by $4 for every $3 points of Manaka's ATK, and ATK by $6 for every $5 points of Manaka's ATK. Lasts for $7 turns. (Up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> points of ATK)\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The Wheel of Time slowly materializes, its rotating gears erupting with a flowing golden halo - this time-blessed sharpness can cleave through all stagnation.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Cure 1 debuff from 1 ally, and make them enter a special Extra Action <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> after their turn. When entering <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link>, that character's status will rewind to their last turn before using a skill. Rewind content includes: {{A}} skill cooldown, current status, current HP, current SP.": "",
  "Cure 1 debuff from 1 ally, and make them enter a special Extra Action [Myriad Song] after their turn. \\nWhen entering [Myriad Song], that character's status will rewind to their last turn before using a skill. \\nRewind content includes: {{A}} skill cooldown, current status, current HP, current SP.": "",
  "Elegance Lv.$1": "",
  "Increase ATK for allies during [Myriad Song] by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>.": "",
  "Increase ATK for allies during [Myriad Song] by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>.": "",
  "Resilience Lv.$1": "",
  "Based on gained [Holy Song] stacks, increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "Based on gained [Holy Song] stacks, increase party's Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "Holy Song": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource, used to increase the skill effect of [Wheel of Time] and decrease [Poem of Radiance] preparation time.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Total DMG Amp</color>": "",
  "Increase Final DMG Amp of all damage. This effect is an independent bonus.": "",
  "Hope to Start Again": "",
  "At the start of each ally's action, Manaka gains $1 <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stack. Stacks up to $2 times. Manaka can use <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> before any ally's action. <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> can only be used once at the start of battle. After using <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link>, restore $4 [Myriad Song] usage after $3 Wonder's non-Extra Action. This effect can be activated once per battle. \\n<link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link>: Cure 1 debuff from 1 ally, and make them enter a special Extra Action <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> after their turn. When entering [Myriad Song], that character's status will rewind to their last turn before using a skill. Rewind content includes: {{B}} skill cooldown, current status, current HP, current SP.": "",
  "Prelude to a Wish": "",
  "At the start of battle, Manaka gains max stacks of <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link>, then decrease her cooldown time by $1 actions. \\nWhen using [Wheel of Time], increase party's Crit Rate by $2 for $3 turns.": "",
  "<size\\=24>Journey of Aspiration</size>": "",
  "Allies during <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> gain $1 <link\\=\"s|236\"><u>Total DMG Amp</u></link>. \\nRestore a KO'd ally's HP equal to $2 of Manaka's ATK + $3. This effect can be activated once per battle.": "",
  "Fluttering Dance": "",
  "Ripples of Silence": "",
  "After any ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{B}} and at the start of battle, Manaka gains $1 <link\\=\"s|235\"><u>[Holy Song]</u></link> stacks that can exceed the cap. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "Echoes of Vigil": "",
  "Eternal Angelic Voice": "",
  "Manaka can initially use <link\\=\"s|239\"><u>[Myriad Song]</u></link> one bonus time.": "",
