  "Assist Skill": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to $1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK ($2 hits), and gain $4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times. When spending <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> to deal damage with [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], increase the skill multiplier by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The faint light transforms into a wandering serpent, coiling around the foe's ankles and fingertips... slithering along their veins, and in an instant, igniting into blazing flames, dealing fire damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Increase party's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Makoto's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. Grant Makoto $4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>It is the fire of conviction, the oath of companionship, a silent yet fervent trust between allies, delivering a warm and empowering strength to comrades.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Use condition: When Makoto has at least $1 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks. \\nSpend all <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link>, for each <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack spent, deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. \\nAlso spend all <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link>, for each <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> stack spent, deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. When this skill is used at $4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks, increase Makoto's Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> and DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Scarlet flames tear through the sky, falling like meteors in a sudden descent. The foe's figure twists within the blaze, as dust and scorching heat surge in its wake...</color></size></b>": "",
  "Ardhanari: Use condition: When Makoto has $1 {{A}} Energy. \\nDeal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK ($2 hits), and gain $4 <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> stack for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times.\\nCadenza: Use condition: When Makoto has $7 {{A}} Energy. \\nIncrease party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> and DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> for $10 turns. Grant Makoto $11 <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> stack for $12 turns. Stacks up to $13 times.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Increase 1 ally's ATK by $14 for $15 turn.": "",
  "Lead Lv.$1": "",
  "After using {{A}}, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>, also increase S.E.E.S. allies' ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "After using {{A}}, increase party's ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>, also increase S.E.E.S. allies' ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "Trust Lv.$1": "",
  "When Makoto receives a buff/healing/shielding from allies, increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times.": "",
  "When Makoto receives a buff/healing/shielding from allies, increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times.": "",
  "When using [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], spend 1 stack to deal 1 hit of damage.": "",
  "Great Guide": "",
  "{{A}} has [Cadenza] and [Ardhanari] two {{B}} skills. At the start of battle, if Makoto's {{B}} Energy is below $1, restore to $2 {{B}} Energy. \\nWhen Makoto receives a buff/healing/shielding from allies, gain $3 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack for $5 turns. Makoto can only gain $4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack from this effect before the start of next turn. Stacks up to $6 times. \\nWhen Makoto has <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link>, increase Pierce by $7/$8/$9 (effect increases at level 1/50/70).": "",
  "Born from Coincidence": "",
  "When using [Melodic Blaze], deal bonus damage ($1 hit). \\nWhen using [Moonlit Hymn], increase party's Pierce by $2 for $3 turns. \\nWhen using [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze] at $4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks, increase Makoto's Crit Rate by $5.": "",
  "Unwavering Heart": "",
  "At the start of Makoto's turn, if <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> reached $1 stacks, automatically use [Moonlit Hymn]. This effect has a 1 turn cooldown.": "",
  "Under the Full Moon": "",
  "Thorny Path": "",
  "[Cadenza] increase party's DMG Dealt by $1. [Ardhanari] deal bonus damage ($2 hit).": "",
  "Blazing Soul": "",
  "The Promise": "",
  "When {{A}} uses any {{B}}, activate the other {{B}}. When spending <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> to deal damage with [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], increase <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $1. \\nWhen {{A}} first receives fatal damage, his HP cannot drop below $2 until the end of his next turn, then enter near death, Makoto will faint when his next turn ends. If Makoto's HP is restored above $3 Max HP during near death, remove near death.": "",
