  "Grant Akihiko $1 [Fighting Spirit] stack. Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, and increase Akihiko's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Arcs of electricity pierce upward from the scorched earth, weaving a cruel cage of lightning that traps all enemies and delivers shocking damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Grant Akihiko $1 [Fighting Spirit] stack. Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, and grant Akihiko $3 [Obsession] stacks.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Two raging thunderbolts converge mid-air, colliding with a deafening crash that sends terrifying surges through all foes, leaving them trembling in the storm's grip.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If Akihiko has $2 or more [Fighting Spirit] stacks, spend all [Fighting Spirit], for each [Fighting Spirit] stack spent, increase skill multiplier by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Fists surge with crackling thunder, striking with mountain-splitting force, no enemy survives this devastating blow.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Lightning Spike: Use condition: When Akihiko has $1 {{A}} Energy\\nDeal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, this skill has <link\\=\"s|220\"><u>[Guaranteed Critical]</u></link>, and has a minimum of $3 Crit DMG and maximum of $4 Crit DMG.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Elec damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Increase 1 ally's Crit DMG by $5 for $6 turn.": "",
  "When Akihiko deals damage to knocked down foes, increase DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>.": "",
  "When Akihiko deals damage to knocked down foes, increase DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color>.": "",
