  "After dealing critical damage, increase ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times.": "",
  "Reason to Fight": "",
  "After Akihiko uses a {{B}} skill/{{C}} to deal Elec damage, gain $1 [Obsession] stack. At the start of battle, gain $2 [Obsession] stacks. Stacks up to $3 times. At the start of Akihiko's turn, he can spend $4 [Obsession] stacks to use [Unstoppable Punch]: Grant Akihiko $5 [Fighting Spirit] stack, and deal Phys damage to all foes equal to $6 of ATK. If foes are downed, increase foes' Downed DMG Taken by $7 for $8 turn. This counts as a Follow Up. \\n[Fighting Spirit]: Increase Akihiko's Pierce by $8. Stacks up to $9 times.": "",
